{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPsuarSq8ZPSwrt5BRJA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I've successfully implemented all three features from BE-005:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field to `Order` and `Shipment` (default 1, must be ≥1)\n- Orders track `OrderFulfilment` with `allocated`, `delivered`, and `status` fields\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to `ShipmentStatus` enum\n- Implemented shipment allocation validation: can't create a shipment if it would exceed the order's quantity\n- Added three shipment transition endpoints:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` (CONFIRMED → DELIVERED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` (CREATED → CANCELLED)\n- Fulfilment status automatically calculated as: DELIVERED (when delivered ≥ quantity), FULLY_ALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, or UNALLOCATED\n- Added `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` to amend order quantities (rejected if below allocated)\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- Orders for non-existent customers rejected with HTTP 422 (UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY)\n- Changed `GET /customers/{customerId}` to return 404 through error envelope\n- Updated `OrderControllerTest` to create customers before creating orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists**\n- All list endpoints (`/customers`, `/orders`, `/shipments`) support:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100)\n  - `offset` parameter (≥0, default 0)\n  - `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n- Invalid parameters rejected with HTTP 400\n- On `/orders`, filtering by `fulfilment` status parameter is supported\n\n**Test Results**: All 13 tests pass ✅\n**No new Maven dependencies** ✅\n**Only scope-approved files modified** ✅"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":808,